					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="823" height="444" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Scheels-US-FREE-LEGO-Make-Take-Gingerbread-Holiday-House-December-2026-Event.jpg" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="Scheels US FREE LEGO Make &amp; Take Gingerbread Holiday House December 2026 Event" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Scheels-US-FREE-LEGO-Make-Take-Gingerbread-Holiday-House-December-2026-Event.jpg 823w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Scheels-US-FREE-LEGO-Make-Take-Gingerbread-Holiday-House-December-2026-Event-300x162.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Scheels-US-FREE-LEGO-Make-Take-Gingerbread-Holiday-House-December-2026-Event-768x414.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 823px) 100vw, 823px" /></p>
<p>Scheels US is a major sporting goods retail chain with over 30 stores in the United States. Scheels</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/free-lego-holiday-gingerbread-house-make-take-event-at-scheels-us-stores-december-2026/">FREE LEGO Holiday Gingerbread House Make &#038; Take Event at Scheels US Stores: December 2026</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=53843&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.scheels.com%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Scheels US</a> is a major sporting goods retail chain with over 30 stores in the United States.</p>
<p><a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=53843&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.scheels.com%2Fe%2Fpost%2Flego-build-event" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-114791 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Scheels-US-FREE-LEGO-Make-Take-Gingerbread-Holiday-House-December-2026-Event.jpg" alt="" width="823" height="444" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Scheels-US-FREE-LEGO-Make-Take-Gingerbread-Holiday-House-December-2026-Event.jpg 823w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Scheels-US-FREE-LEGO-Make-Take-Gingerbread-Holiday-House-December-2026-Event-300x162.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Scheels-US-FREE-LEGO-Make-Take-Gingerbread-Holiday-House-December-2026-Event-768x414.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 823px) 100vw, 823px" /></a></p>
<p><a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=53843&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.scheels.com%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Scheels US</a> will be having a really fun free LEGO Make &amp; Take event. Different stores have different dates but most seem to be in the month of December 2026. The build will be a LEGO Holiday Gingerbread House. <strong>Reservations are required in order to participate in the free event.</strong> For more details and to make your reservation, visit the <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=53843&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.scheels.com%2Fe%2Fpost%2Flego-build-event" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Scheels US LEGO Building Event page</a>.</p>
<p><a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=53843&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.scheels.com%2Fe%2Fpost%2Flego-build-event" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-114792 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Scheels-US-FREE-LEGO-Make-Take-Gingerbread-Holiday-House-December-2026-Event-Landing-Page.jpg" alt="" width="1290" height="852" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Scheels-US-FREE-LEGO-Make-Take-Gingerbread-Holiday-House-December-2026-Event-Landing-Page.jpg 1290w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Scheels-US-FREE-LEGO-Make-Take-Gingerbread-Holiday-House-December-2026-Event-Landing-Page-300x198.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Scheels-US-FREE-LEGO-Make-Take-Gingerbread-Holiday-House-December-2026-Event-Landing-Page-1024x676.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Scheels-US-FREE-LEGO-Make-Take-Gingerbread-Holiday-House-December-2026-Event-Landing-Page-768x507.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1290px) 100vw, 1290px" /></a></p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com. Subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get LEGO news, new product updates, sales &amp; deals updates, creations and reviews right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates.</p>
