<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-113621 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Revealed-Front-Box.png" alt="" width="874" height="734" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Revealed-Front-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Revealed-Front-Box-300x252.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Revealed-Front-Box-1024x860.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Revealed-Front-Box-768x645.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 874px) 100vw, 874px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-113625 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Revealed-Back-Box.png" alt="" width="973" height="816" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Revealed-Back-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Revealed-Back-Box-300x252.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Revealed-Back-Box-1024x858.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Revealed-Back-Box-768x644.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 973px) 100vw, 973px" /></p>
<h3><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Official Product Description &#8211; 40898 Venetian Water Taxi GWP </span></h3>
<blockquote><p>Bring a touch of Venice to your home or office with this LEGO® Icons Venetian Water Taxi (40898) decor building set for adults and travel lovers. This fun set features a classic water taxi and a dock setting, plus captain and tourist minifigures, accessories and 2 pigeon figures for storytelling. Build it as a stand-alone model or add it to the LEGO Icons Venetian Neighborhood (11388), a highly detailed diorama inspired by the canals and architecture of the legendary city.</p>
<p>-CLASSIC VENETIAN TAXI – Take a creative voyage to the splendor of Venice with the LEGO® Icons Venetian Water Taxi (40898) decor building set for adults and travel lovers</p>
<p>-WHAT’S IN THE BOX – Includes everything you need to build a classic Venetian water taxi and detailed dock setting, together with captain and tourist minifigures and 2 pigeon figures</p>
<p>-INTERACTIVE FEATURES – Place the pilot minifigure in the driver’s seat, then open the rear of the boat to load the suitcase and board the passenger</p>
<p>-FUN TRAVEL DECOR – A compact and charming build that captures the spirit of Venice, great for display on a shelf or desk in the home or office</p>
<p>-EXPAND YOUR CREATIVITY– Add this set to the LEGO® Icons Venetian Neighborhood (11388), a highly detailed diorama inspired by the canals and architecture of the legendary city</p>
<p>-DIMENSIONS – The boat in this 322-piece LEGO® Icons Venetian Water Taxi set measures over 2 in. (5 cm) high, 7 in. (18 cm) long and 2 in. (5 cm) wide</p></blockquote>
<p><strong>Shop Now at LEGO:</strong> <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a></p>
