					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="1800" height="1800" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Disney-43280-Beach-Fun-with-Lilo-and-Stitch-June-2026-Product-Image-1.png" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="LEGO Disney 43280 Beach Fun with Lilo and Stitch June 2026 Product Image 1" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Disney-43280-Beach-Fun-with-Lilo-and-Stitch-June-2026-Product-Image-1.png 1800w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Disney-43280-Beach-Fun-with-Lilo-and-Stitch-June-2026-Product-Image-1-300x300.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Disney-43280-Beach-Fun-with-Lilo-and-Stitch-June-2026-Product-Image-1-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Disney-43280-Beach-Fun-with-Lilo-and-Stitch-June-2026-Product-Image-1-150x150.png 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Disney-43280-Beach-Fun-with-Lilo-and-Stitch-June-2026-Product-Image-1-768x768.png 768w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Disney-43280-Beach-Fun-with-Lilo-and-Stitch-June-2026-Product-Image-1-1536x1536.png 1536w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1800px) 100vw, 1800px" /></p>
<p>Good Morning Everyone! Amazon US currently has some LEGO deals for today. Free shipping on orders above $35.</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/12-handpicked-best-amazon-us-lego-deals-sales-list-for-this-morning-november-14-2026/">12 Handpicked Best Amazon US LEGO Deals &#038; Sales List for This Morning, November 14, 2026</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Good Morning Everyone! <a href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19">Amazon US</a> currently has some LEGO deals for today. Free shipping on orders above $35. As always, prices can fluctuate at anytime.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-108067 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Disney-43280-Beach-Fun-with-Lilo-and-Stitch-June-2026-Lifestyle-4.jpg" alt="" width="1158" height="772" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Disney-43280-Beach-Fun-with-Lilo-and-Stitch-June-2026-Lifestyle-4.jpg 1800w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Disney-43280-Beach-Fun-with-Lilo-and-Stitch-June-2026-Lifestyle-4-300x200.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Disney-43280-Beach-Fun-with-Lilo-and-Stitch-June-2026-Lifestyle-4-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Disney-43280-Beach-Fun-with-Lilo-and-Stitch-June-2026-Lifestyle-4-768x512.jpg 768w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Disney-43280-Beach-Fun-with-Lilo-and-Stitch-June-2026-Lifestyle-4-1536x1024.jpg 1536w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1158px) 100vw, 1158px" /></p>
<p>My favorite deal would be the <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-Sunflowers-Building-Kids-Girls/dp/B0FNRXHL41?th=1&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=7c80866a19990e2ddac11f368de65f31&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Sunflowers 40524</a> at 40% off for <strong>$8.99</strong> (reg.$14.99). I also really like this cute <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-TBD-Disney-Classic-43280/dp/B0G2SS5VVV?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=01c641b66cea0f8ea455ff2723a38ec7&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Disney Beach Fun with Lilo &amp; Stitch 43280</a> set at 20% off for <strong>$15.99</strong> (reg.$19.99). Lilo and Stitch fans would definitely enjoy this set. Price wise, its quite affordable too.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-80342 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/LEGO-40524-Sunflowers-January-2022-Release-Date.jpg" alt="" width="860" height="978" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/LEGO-40524-Sunflowers-January-2022-Release-Date.jpg 860w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/LEGO-40524-Sunflowers-January-2022-Release-Date-264x300.jpg 264w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/LEGO-40524-Sunflowers-January-2022-Release-Date-768x873.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 860px) 100vw, 860px" /></p>
<p>Below are 12 of our Handpicked Best Amazon US LEGO Deals &amp; Sales List for This Morning, November 14, 2026. Be sure to subscribe to our email so you don’t miss out on any other LEGO Sales &amp; Deals happening in the USA!</p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get a choice of daily LEGO News, LEGO Sales &amp; Deals or All Updates right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates.</p>
<h3>12 Handpicked Best Amazon US LEGO Deals &amp; Sales List for This Morning, November 14, 2026</h3>
<ul>
<li>20% off &#8211; <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-Friends-Stable-Academy-Building/dp/B0FMS7HSJ8?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=3ebdb0557d7010abde1f3c33f90e59d8&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Friends Horse Stable and Riding Academy 42688</a><strong> $71.95</strong> (reg.$89.99)</li>
<li>14% off &#8211; <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-TBD-DUPLO-Town-10427/dp/B0CV2BX49N?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=f8240628a7d41afb429d8ed4131e77fc&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO DUPLO Interactive Adventure Train 10427</a> <strong>$68.57</strong> (reg.$79.99)</li>
</ul>
