<ul>
<li>24% off &#8211; LEGO Creator 3in1 31377 Turtle with a Water Lily Flower <strong>$9.86</strong> (reg.$12.99)</li>
<li>21% off &#8211; LEGO Icons 10353 Williams Racing FW14B &amp; Nigel Mansell F1 <strong>$79</strong> (reg.$99.99)</li>
<li><strong>Shop Now:</strong> <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36751&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.walmart.ca" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wal-Mart Canada Online</a></li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-103026 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Creator-3in1-31377-Turtle-with-a-Water-Lily-Flower-January-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="760" height="745" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Creator-3in1-31377-Turtle-with-a-Water-Lily-Flower-January-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 862w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Creator-3in1-31377-Turtle-with-a-Water-Lily-Flower-January-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x294.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Creator-3in1-31377-Turtle-with-a-Water-Lily-Flower-January-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x753.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-103027 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Creator-3in1-31377-Turtle-with-a-Water-Lily-Flower-January-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box.jpg" alt="" width="861" height="868" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Creator-3in1-31377-Turtle-with-a-Water-Lily-Flower-January-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box.jpg 861w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Creator-3in1-31377-Turtle-with-a-Water-Lily-Flower-January-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-298x300.jpg 298w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Creator-3in1-31377-Turtle-with-a-Water-Lily-Flower-January-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-150x150.jpg 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Creator-3in1-31377-Turtle-with-a-Water-Lily-Flower-January-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-768x774.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 861px) 100vw, 861px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-92522 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/18-LEGO-Icons-10353-Williams-Racing-FW14B-Nigel-Mansell-March-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="980" height="787" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/18-LEGO-Icons-10353-Williams-Racing-FW14B-Nigel-Mansell-March-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 980w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/18-LEGO-Icons-10353-Williams-Racing-FW14B-Nigel-Mansell-March-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x241.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/18-LEGO-Icons-10353-Williams-Racing-FW14B-Nigel-Mansell-March-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x617.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 980px) 100vw, 980px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-92523 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/18-LEGO-Icons-10353-Williams-Racing-FW14B-Nigel-Mansell-March-2025-Release-Date-Back-Box.jpg" alt="" width="932" height="742" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/18-LEGO-Icons-10353-Williams-Racing-FW14B-Nigel-Mansell-March-2025-Release-Date-Back-Box.jpg 932w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/18-LEGO-Icons-10353-Williams-Racing-FW14B-Nigel-Mansell-March-2025-Release-Date-Back-Box-300x239.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/18-LEGO-Icons-10353-Williams-Racing-FW14B-Nigel-Mansell-March-2025-Release-Date-Back-Box-768x611.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 932px) 100vw, 932px" /></p>
<p>*<strong>More great LEGO sales buys can be found on the <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36751&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.walmart.ca%2Fen%2Fsearch%3Fq%3Dlego%26facet%3Dfacet_ss_BestSellers%253ABestSellers%257C%257Cretailer_type%253AWalmart%26affinityOverride%3Ddefault" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wal-Mart Canada LEGO Bestsellers List</a>. </strong>Make sure to filter the seller to Wal-Mart Canada (and not third party sellers) and choose Best Selling Items.</p>
<p>We also have a <strong><a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-sales-deals-list-canada/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada LEGO Sales Page Hub</a></strong> too. The <strong>page is updated regularly</strong> so that you don&#8217;t miss out on any bargains. For more <strong>LEGO Sales Finds submitted by Toys N Bricks forum members</strong>, you can <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/forum/index.php?/forum/17-general-lego-sales-deals-forum-members-only/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">visit our LEGO Sales &amp; Deals forum section</a>. Registration for a forum membership account is<strong> free and fast</strong>.</p>
<p><strong>More LEGO reads at Toys N Bricks:</strong> <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-news/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO News</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-resources/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Resource Guides</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/legoland-resources/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND Resource Guides</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-reviews/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Reviews</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-sales-deals-list-usa/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">US LEGO Deals</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-sales-deals-list-canada/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada LEGO Deals</a></p>
<p><strong>Visit our LEGO Forums:</strong> Where traditional and classic meets our <a href="https://www.toysnbricksforum.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Legacy LEGO Forums</a>. A library of LEGO resources and for members to ask questions. All articles posted on our main site at Toysnbricks.com are posted in the forums as well. The best part is that there are no ads in our LEGO forums. Registration for a basic forum account is free and fast.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-113380 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo.jpg" alt="" width="843" height="673" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo.jpg 999w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo-300x240.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo-768x613.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 843px) 100vw, 843px" /></p>
